 "min_shell": 1,
 "notes": [
  "Send when you're home: a Claude message that can't get through (like on school wifi) waits and sends by itself once Claude can be reached. Send now or Cancel any time.",
  "The note-taker does the same: press Stop anywhere, and the notes are made by themselves when Claude can be reached. Nothing gets in your way meanwhile.",
  "Check Claude (Settings > AI) tells you if Claude works here, you're offline, or this network blocks it.",
  "Search finds words inside your photos, PDFs, drawings and voice memos (your PC reads them while it's on; turn it on in Settings).",
  "Fixes: the sync status no longer says Synced when a note is too big to go up, sharing a PDF to Vault as a note keeps the file, and the Ctrl+N tip only shows where it works."
 ],
